-What are they?

73
00:03:58.400 --> 00:03:59.880
-Grey oyster mushrooms.
-Oh. my God.

74
00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:02.120
I've made a thing for them.

75
00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:04.360
