-Mushroom soup?

89
00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:33.240
Yeah. Whatever you like.

90
00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:34.760
-Vegan burger.
-Yeah!

91
00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:36.800
