-[Jeremy] Shit.

92
00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.920
[chuckles]

93
00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:40.240
[Lisa] What have you done?

94
00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:43.120
What's wrong. love?

95
00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:46.360
