-Fuck!

138
00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:26.000
[soft joyful music]

139
00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:31.320
[Jeremy] <i>Lisa decided to celebrate
this victory over the council</i>

140
00:06:31.480 --> 00:06:35.560
