163
00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:43.800
[Lisa] Right. Okay. Let's take a fatty.

164
00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.000
-Don't! Stop eating my jeans.
-[Lisa] Quick.

165
00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:48.760
-Uh-uh-uh. Stop it. No.
-[Jeremy laughs]

166
00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:51.960
[Lisa] Ow!

167
00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:54.040
