168
00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:57.120
-[Jeremy laughs]
-Okay. That is 96.

169
00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:59.640
You didn't... Well. 96 what?

170
00:07:59.800 --> 00:08:00.640
Pounds?

171
00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:02.080
