No. don't let go! Bring it back
or else we're gonna lose it.

177
00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:20.240
[Lisa] Wait. I'm just... Oh. my God.
We're gonna be here for days.

178
00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:22.760
