207
00:09:30.760 --> 00:09:33.880
Christ Al-bloody-mighty.
This is a porker.

208
00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:36.480
Wow. 28.66.

209
00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:38.200
-Oh!
-[bleating]

210
00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:41.200
