-Yes. I've got that wrong.

211
00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:42.320
23.92.

212
00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:46.200
So you have grown good.
solid. healthy goats!

213
00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:48.720
